# landmark (assets/world3d/scarecrow/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# The Scarecrow's Field: the scarecrow himself, big as a tower over the back
# hedge on his post with a crow on his arm, hay bales stacked in the corners.
cylinder wood    at 192 0 13.5 size 5 70 5 id scarecrow-post
box      wood    at 192 46 13.5 size 72 4 5 id scarecrow-arms
